# VHS tape file — run `vhs demo.tape` to generate demo.gif
# Requires: https://github.com/charmbracelet/vhs

Output demo.gif
Set FontSize 22
Set Width 1000
Set Height 600
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 40ms

Type "prism review 13"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 2s

Type "# Compressing diff... stripped 3 files (saved 42 KB)"
Sleep 1s
Enter

Type "# Dispatching 7 agents..."
Sleep 500ms
Enter

Type "  ✓ Know-It-All   (1.8s)"
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Type "  ✓ Architect      (2.1s)"
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Type "  ✓ Solver         (1.5s)"
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Type "  ✓ Editor         (1.9s)"
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Type "  ✓ Optimizer      (1.3s)"
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Type "  ✓ Sentinel       (2.4s)"
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Type "  ✓ Test Engineer  (1.7s)"
Sleep 500ms
Enter

Type "# Deduplicating findings... 18 → 12 (6 merged)"
Sleep 500ms
Enter

Type "# Health Score: 94/100 (A) — approve"
Sleep 500ms
Enter

Type "# Report saved to results/prism-pr-13.html"
Sleep 500ms
Enter

Type "# Tokens: 142k input, 18k output | Cost: $0.34 | Time: 23s"
Sleep 3s
